Patch: 011-web-search-live
Reason: a session may turn on Codex's own web search, live, which sets web_search = "live" in Codex's config, a key the harness reserves; the harness hands the config it generated to its machine's optional configure hook before writing it, and the machine (this package's own, host/machine.ts) sets the setting there, so the harness carries one line and no web search logic
Upstream: ours
Pins: web search live through the pinned binary: the run completes past a web_search_call, the proxy forwards the recorded live tool, and the search is booked
---
diff --git a/packages/harness-codex/src/harness.ts b/packages/harness-codex/src/harness.ts
index 436c2a9..f581121 100644
--- a/packages/harness-codex/src/harness.ts
+++ b/packages/harness-codex/src/harness.ts
@@ -508,6 +508,7 @@ export function codexHarness(options: CodexHarnessOptions = {}): Harness {
           ...(options.config ?? {}),
         },
       });
+      machine.configure?.(config);
       await machine.files.upload('codex-home', [
         { path: 'config.toml', bytes: new TextEncoder().encode(toToml(config)) },
         ...(resume ? [{ path: resume.path, bytes: rolloutBytes }] : []),
